<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16565" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀστός</span></b> , ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄστυ</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>townsman, citizen,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				11.242
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				13.192
			</span></i>, etc.; dist. from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολίτης,
			ἀστός</span> being <i>one who has civil rights</i> only,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολίτης</span>
			<i>one who has political rights</i> also, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1278a34
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. πικρὸς πολίταις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Med.</u>
					223
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ἀ.</span>
			<i>the commons,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ἀγαθοί,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				3.71
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				3.21
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξένος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				7.90
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.160
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				3.8
			</span></i>; esp. at Athens, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				6.17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ap.</u>
				30a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
			</span></i> l.c., cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				817
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OC</u>
				13
			</span></i>, etc.; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέτοικος, ξένος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				563a
			</span></i>; in Egypt, <i>citizen of Alexandria</i> (cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄστυ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.3
				</span></i>
			), <i><span class="en">
				<u>PGnom.</u>
				38
			</span></i>, al. —Fem. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀστή,</span>
			q. v., but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀστός</span> fem. as epith.
			of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κόρη,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(5).225
			</span></i> (Paros, <span class="entity">v B. C.</span>). (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ϝασστός</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ϝαστός,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				9(1).333.14
			</span></i> (
				Locr.
			, <span class="entity">v B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				9(2).1226
			</span></i> (Phalanna, <span class="entity">v B.C.</span>).)</div>
